Failure Flow

Suppose Shipping Service fails:
Order Created ✅
Payment Success ✅
Inventory Reserved ✅
Shipping Failed ❌

Now Orchestrator starts rollback:
Shipping Failed
       |
       v
Saga Orchestrator
